{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack to Ascension is a management simulator where you govern an immortal cultivation sect. Coordinate your sect's resource production and cultivation, nurturing disciples through a gradually improved automation system, and lead your disciples to immortal ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-6.png?t=1752744174\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness spiritual veins and shape the land. Build your unique cultivation stronghold, managing everything from constructing grand halls to recruiting talented disciples. Every decision determines your sect's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/2e098819d88f1f1e045c6a943e1e4e14.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/2e098819d88f1f1e045c6a943e1e4e14.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/2e098819d88f1f1e045c6a943e1e4e14.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-10.png?t=1752744174\" /></div>Decipher yin-yang principles and celestial mechanisms. Develop an automated system, using mystical formations and buildings to accelerate cultivation, enhance production, repel invaders, and establish impregnable sect defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/979596e9bb90cc0685bda63ecc38fb16.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/979596e9bb90cc0685bda63ecc38fb16.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/979596e9bb90cc0685bda63ecc38fb16.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-7.png?t=1752744174\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this merciless cultivation world, mere resource management isn't enough. Monitor disciples' progress, help them survive heavenly tribulations, fend off demonic beast invasions, and maintain your sect's prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/079b42381a2edc7f6710099350582133.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/079b42381a2edc7f6710099350582133.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/079b42381a2edc7f6710099350582133.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-8.png?t=1752744174\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This realm pulses with Five Elements spiritual energy, concealing rare heavenly materials. Each element influences cultivation efficiency - strategically relocate to energy-rich zones to boost your sect's overall power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/42830fd046ccc5e1cdd246c579424570.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/42830fd046ccc5e1cdd246c579424570.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/42830fd046ccc5e1cdd246c579424570.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-9.png?t=1752744174\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The immortal continent's vast expanse holds perpetual dangers. Strengthen your sect to unlock fog-shrouded regions, discovering both opportunities and challenges in uncharted territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/3ada73ec242af7d926531826f5877f50.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/3ada73ec242af7d926531826f5877f50.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/3ada73ec242af7d926531826f5877f50.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612130?t=1752744174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/a89b6ff386edc399ee8be03a8aec2abf71536333/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752744174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/3e072bdded7ca3ca0ff7ab9c0e8abe56aadfe81d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752744174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/3e072bdded7ca3ca0ff7ab9c0e8abe56aadfe81d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752744174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack to Ascension is a management simulator where you govern an immortal cultivation sect. Coordinate your sect's resource production and cultivation, nurturing disciples through a gradually improved automation system, and lead your disciples to immortal ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-6.png?t=1752744174\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness spiritual veins and shape the land. Build your unique cultivation stronghold, managing everything from constructing grand halls to recruiting talented disciples. Every decision determines your sect's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/2e098819d88f1f1e045c6a943e1e4e14.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/2e098819d88f1f1e045c6a943e1e4e14.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/2e098819d88f1f1e045c6a943e1e4e14.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-10.png?t=1752744174\" /></div>Decipher yin-yang principles and celestial mechanisms. Develop an automated system, using mystical formations and buildings to accelerate cultivation, enhance production, repel invaders, and establish impregnable sect defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/979596e9bb90cc0685bda63ecc38fb16.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/979596e9bb90cc0685bda63ecc38fb16.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/979596e9bb90cc0685bda63ecc38fb16.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/EN-7.png?t=1752744174\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this merciless cultivation world, mere resource management isn't enough. Monitor disciples' progress, help them survive heavenly tribulations, fend off demonic beast invasions, and maintain your sect's prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/079b42381a2edc7f6710099350582133.poster.avif?t=1752744174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/079b42381a2edc7f6710099350582133.webm?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612130/extras/079b42381a2edc7f6710099350582133.mp4?t=1752744174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_par